## Customize flags given to the VM: https://erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Remove Erlang's default logger handler to prevent non-JSON SASL progress
## reports during boot. Elixir's Logger adds its own handler with the configured
## JSON formatter instead.
-kernel logger [{handler,default,undefined}]

## Number of dirty schedulers doing IO work (file, sockets, and others)
##+SDio 5

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
##+Q 65536

## Tweak GC to run more often
##-env ERL_FULLSWEEP_AFTER 10
